Package: Robjgrader
Type: Package
Title: Runtime Object Recorder and Semantic Validator for Teaching in R
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Niklas", "Haehn",
      email = "niklas.haehn@ucsd.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Records analytical objects produced during the execution of an R
    script and validates them against pedagogical or substantive expectations.
    Designed for methods teaching, automated grading, and reproducibility
    checks.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://niklashaehn.github.io/robjgrader, https://github.com/NiklasHaehn/robjgrader
